E={58: 'The doll stares blankly without voice. A few seconds of those unblinking eyes and their glare, soulless with a soul movement. The doll moves his right arm by the slightest of raise. It takes a whole second for his arm straight to raise the hand an inch, and it is still moving. The woman is seeing him slowly raise; it creates a stiff in her neck. She is darting her eyes up and down him while his eyes stare into hers, even while his arm is raising. Seconds, and a few more, his hand pointing by the index, until it finds its place; his finger points at a painting of himself she created, his hand unmoving now. She sees it.'}
